# nr-office-pdf-author-draw: mixdog-pdf author module (wrapText, colours, page sizes, rounding, PNG/JPEG/SVG image embedding)

Not compiled: cargo was not run (the lead compiles the wave). The font choice of pdf-fonts.mjs is not in this task: it is
already `mixdog_pdf::embed::{embed_document_font, embed_bold_font, unicode_font_path}` (task nr-office-pdf-embed, replayed by
twin_embed), so there is no author/fonts.rs.

## native/core/crates/mixdog-pdf/src/lib.rs

After `pub mod image;` add:

    pub mod author;

## native/core/crates/mixdog-pdf/Cargo.toml

[dependencies], after `mixdog-js = { workspace = true }`:

    mixdog-office-base = { workspace = true }
    mixdog-raster = { workspace = true }
    serde_json = { workspace = true }

[dev-dependencies], after `serde_json = { workspace = true }`:

    sha2 = { workspace = true }

(mixdog-office-base stays in dev-dependencies too, with `features = ["test-support"]`, for the twin helpers. No dependency
cycle: mixdog-office-base depends on fsio, js, rt, statefile; mixdog-raster on image, imaging, rt, fonts, fsio, none on mixdog-pdf.
No crate outside native/core/Cargo.lock is added.)

## Cargo.lock and mixdog-workspace-hack

`cargo update --workspace --offline`: the package mixdog-pdf gains the dependencies mixdog-office-base, mixdog-raster, serde_json
and (dev) sha2, all already in the lock.

