## Where the writer tasks call it

`mixdog_pdf::author::draw::{embed_image, page_size, parse_color, round2, EmbeddedImage}` and
`mixdog_pdf::author::wrap::wrap_text(text, width, |s| font.width_of_text_at_size(s, size))` (nr-office-pdf-writer,
nr-office-pdf-forms, nr-office-pdf-content-ops). `embed_image` registers the image objects into the document's
`ObjectStore` at once (pdf-lib registers them when the page is saved: the object numbers of a writer that wants pdf-lib's
order are that task's to arrange); the SVG logo needs a `SvgFonts` (`SvgFonts::none()` draws no text).
